WEBVTT

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:40.670
Godai!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:43.400
Kyoko!

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.730
Congratulations on passing
your test! Please take this...

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:57.950
I-It's...

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.290
Wear them when
you start classes.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:06.670
Thank you.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.640
K-Kyoko...

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:32.670
Godai...

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.000
Godai hasn't
come home yet?

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.700
It's been a week.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:25.320
This is when they post the
results for the exams he's failed.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.950
He left because of
all your pranks.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:34.050
We don't play pranks.
We just tell him the truth.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.790
That is a prank.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.420
I'm worried about him.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.770
It's a dangerous
time of year.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.510
Once he knows he's failed
he'll be back.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.820
Godai, are you
okay with this?

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.380
Okay with what?

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.570
You gotta stop
hiding sometime.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:00.830
I won't go back to Maison Ikkoku
until I've passed an exam!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.440
So you're going to stay
at my place for a whole year?

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.730
Listen you...

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.800
H-Hey look!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.370
All right!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.210
We're eating Korean
Bar-B-Que tonight!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.570
Who is!?
I need to buy underwear.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.620
Underwear?

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.250
Token Exchange

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.500
C'mon, let's go out
for Bar-B-Que!

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.150
No! I need
new underwear!

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.450
Just whose room
are you staying in?

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.830
At least let me
borrow some underwear.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:44.640
It ain't something
you loan out.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.780
I'm the one who
hit the jackpot, not you!

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.160
Idiot! Why not just get
them from your apartment?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.150
Th-The key!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:42.860
I-I forgot it!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:07.880
What was that noise?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.320
How enjoyable that looks.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.340
ls this some new game?

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.280
N-No, l...

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.010
M-My underwear...

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.250
Oh, please.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:49.890
M-Mr. Yotsuya...

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.270
''Ronin Plunges to His Death... ''

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.610
''Another suicide victim of exam hell. ''

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:01.510
Oh, no!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:08.200
Oh good, it doesn't
sound like Godai.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:12.390
But I've had it! If he's going
to stay out, he could call me!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:41.060
Soichiro...

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:45.900
Soichiro!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.140
Soichiro, what are these?

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:08.940
Kibarashi Public Baths

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.410
Coin-Op Laundry

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.180
S-So cold...

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.290
I'm waiting
for the washer.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:03.060
You're not wearing
underpants, are you?

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:23.550
- - Who is that old lady?
- - That's her fifth one!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:57.730
Hello?

00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.020
Godai?

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.180
Godai!
Is that you, Godai?

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.340
Just who do
you think you are?

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:15.040
Everyone was so worried,
we couldn't even eat.

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.910
But please come home.
We're all waiting for you.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.730
Uhh, this is Godai
isn't it?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.410
Clock Hill Station

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.660
Y-You wouldn't be...?

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.690
You're from
Maison Ikkoku...

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.500
And you're Godai's...

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.570
A fine meal.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:46.280
Thank you for taking care
of my grandson.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.030
Thank you.
He's such a gentleman.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:51.570
No, my grandson is...

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.600
No, the pleasure
is all mine.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.220
You're too kind.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.600
- - Such a polite greeting...
- - My grandson is so lucky to...

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.230
Yo, Granny!
My bowl...!

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:02.300
Whoops.

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:09.410
Thanks for
carrying my bags.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.430
Not at all.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.190
I thought Yusaku
would pick me up.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:14.500
Yusaku?

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.340
My grandson.
That's his name.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:17.680
The ronin's...?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.160
You didn't know?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.670
W-Well, now that
you mention it...

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.930
''Ronin '' is his occupation,
not his name... I knew that.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.600
What's with that brat!?

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:35.300
He should've gotten my postcard
days ago, so where was he?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.810
''Days ago ''? He couldn't
have read the postcard yet.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:56.960
Hey, Sakamoto.

00:12:58.400 --> 00:12:59.920
Can I stay a
few more days?

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.810
No problem here,
but how about you?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.160
What do you mean?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.940
You ought to contact
your manager.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:10.580
Hey, d'ya gotta
rub my nose in it!?

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.470
I'm used to Akemi and
Yotsuya making a fool of me.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:19.030
But...

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:20.780
But...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.320
When the manager looks at
me with pity in her eyes...

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.880
I just can't take it!

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.400
You're pathetic!

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:32.820
Yep, pathetic!

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.350
Totally pathetic!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:39.390
Completely pathetic!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.650
Cut it out! You're making
me even more pathetic!

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.310
Manager!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.320
Shall we?

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:07.760
You found Godai yet?

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.910
Of course I have!

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.710
This is Godai's grandmother.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:18.030
Don't shout.
I can hear you.

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:22.910
Let's stop for
a cup of coffee.

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:24.450
But...

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.810
It'll be my treat.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.020
Akemi, can we talk?

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.770
We'll be along soon.
Please go on ahead.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.430
ls she really
Godai's grandma?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:47.360
She certainly is. So for now,
please don't tell her about Godai.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.930
She may find
out eventually.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:55.720
But she just got here,
and we shouldn't worry her.

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.500
Can't keep it a secret.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.270
But...

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.190
if we can find
him before dark...

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.770
What I meant was...

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:07.420
My heart felt condolences
at your great loss.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:09.850
See?

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:13.720
So Yusaku failed all
his entrance exams?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.410
It is but a matter of time.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.310
Therefore, this past week...

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.010
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.980
Greetings, Manager!

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.950
What might this mean?

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.210
She shouldn't even bother.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:37.880
Grandma Godai...

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.880
We made her cry!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.060
Grandma Godai...

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.580
I'm sorry.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:01.450
He probably ran away.
I can always tell with him.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.660
He's so gutless.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:11.610
There's nothing to worry about.
He's just pretending to suffer.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.310
Ain't that great, Manager?

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.700
When his grandma says it,
it must be true.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:20.440
I-I couldn't care...

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:24.340
Darn straight. The tenants at
Maison Ikkoku are cold hearted.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:28.720
Only the manager was
worried about him.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:30.790
Master!

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:33.450
What's the problem?
It's true.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.060
You guys always
twist the facts.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:43.500
What should we do?
Godai is still missing...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.080
When do they post
the exam results?

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.710
They post the results for his last
private college tomorrow.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.530
The public school's
postings are much later.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.940
The public schools were
impossible from the start.

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:00.560
So the game will
be up tomorrow.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:01.830
I imagine so.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.310
If he fails tomorrow...

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.760
Then Yusaku's
coming home!

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:13.460
It's only natural.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:17.520
We aren't rich enough
to support a ronin.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.610
The object of my
amusement is vanishing.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.560
Thank you for
coming with me.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:50.950
My pleasure...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.050
I hope he passes.

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:58.160
I hate to see
my grandson cry...

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:00.900
Third-Rate University

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.270
- - That's my number!
- - I passed!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.160
- - This is great!
- - Where's mine?

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.860
What do you think?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.200
Grandma Godai
did he pass?

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.490
H-He couldn't have...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.500
M-M-Manager, l...

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.050
Yes?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.690
I-l...

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:53.900
Yes?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.910
Yusaku's...

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.730
Yes, Grandma Godai?

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.940
I have no idea what
Yusaku's number is.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.580
The crowd's so thick
we can't see a thing.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.470
Let's wait until it clears out.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.660
Idiot! You may have all day,
but I don't!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.790
How does it look
Grandma Godai?'

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:32.400
I thought Yusaku would
be here for sure.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:33.810
I-I see.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.630
Ready, Godai?

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:40.370
That's good, Sakamoto!
That's the spirit!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.320
Just hurry up and
find your number!

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:52.130
Hey, Godai!

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:56.000
That's Yusaku!
After him!

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:56.810
O-Okay!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:00.760
Why, you...

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:04.860
Take this!

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:08.270
Yusaku!

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:10.580
Godai!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.810
Ma-ma-ma-g-g-g...

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:18.200
You're the maggot here!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:21.740
The m-manager and G-Grandma.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:26.160
But Grandma
what're you doing h' ere?

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:30.060
Who cares about that!?
Did you pass or not?

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:32.560
Well? Well? Well?
Well? Well? Well?

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:33.390
Hey! Hey!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.820
I haven't seen it yet!

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:39.840
You coward!
What are you waiting for!?

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.820
Don't hit.
I'll get brain damage!

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:44.740
- - Shut up!
- - Grandma Godai!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.390
It's thinning out.
Shall we go take a look?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.240
Shall we, Godai?

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:56.630
Successful Test Numbers

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:26.210
T-That's it!

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:30.780
It's there!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.300
Manager...

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:56.720
Ma, stop it.
You're embarrassing me!

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.510
Grandma, stop it!
You're embarrassing me!

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.580
We're usually the
life of the party.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:05.920
I'm just not
in the mood tonight.

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:07.240
Indubitably.

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:12.480
But you're lucky. Your
plaything's sticking around.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:16.600
Godai is my personal toy!

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:22.190
Drink as much as you want!
I'll allow it, tonight.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.560
Manager,
sorry about this.

00:22:29.970 --> 00:22:32.720
W-What's this?
Hey, let me go!

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:44.110
W-What'd you go
and do that for?

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:46.270
Godai, these are for you.

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:49.810
I washed them for you.

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:53.120
Madam Manager...

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:54.250
Yes?

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:57.060
What, pray tell, is that?

00:22:58.320 --> 00:23:00.700
Yeah, what izzat?

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:02.660
I-It's nothing!

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:04.630
Yusaku! What did
you do this time?

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:08.250
N-Nothing, Grandma Godai.
It's really nothing.

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:09.920
Then what is it?

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:13.610
I mean, it's not what
you're thinking!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.450
What are we thinking, then?

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.100
I-I just...

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:20.650
Let's drink! Manager!
Drink up!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:23.190
Let's make
this party lively!

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:26.400
That's the spirit!
Party hardy!

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:27.780
Ma!

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:29.810
M-Manager...

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:53.950
Godai is a college student, and
spring has come to Maison Ikkoku!

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:57.980
But the season of cherry
blossoms is a sad one for me.

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:02.280
Next: ''Shocking Springtime!
Kyoko's Secret. ''

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:03.860
Actually, l...

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:06.630
No, I'll tell you
about it next time.
